  "description": "I’ve been reunited with my ex, who’s lost his memory.\nAnd on a straight dating TV show, no less!\n\n*“It’s not that I’m looking down on you, but I do feel a bit let down, Seojeong.”  \n“I’m just a bit shy around new people, Cha Yoon.”*\n\nSeven years of dating, reset by a sudden accident. Appearing as someone else’s ex after their break-up, Cha Yoon picks on Seojeong at every turn, finding fault with everything he does.\n\n*“Do you think I’m a pervert like you?”  \n“Well, perhaps only someone like Cha Yoon, who’s an exhibitionist, would think that.”*\n\nGrowing weary of Cha Yoon’s constant bickering and recurring conflicts, Seojeong eventually tried to ignore him, but… somehow, Cha Yoon seems a bit out of sorts.\n\n*“Why aren’t you sending me any messages?”*  \n[ Your ex has chosen you. ]\n\nThe inscrutable inner thoughts of his ‘precious’ ex, who has become seven years younger! Will Seojeong manage to see through him within the time limit?\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302038519), Chapters ([R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302030058), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302030059))\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302055962)",
